    },
    {
      "id": "s0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "vfs_extd_audit — record selected Samba VFS operations",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Synopsis",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "code",
            "text": "vfs objects = extd_audit"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "DESCRIPTION",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This VFS module is part of the [[p0]] suite.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "link",
            "text": "samba(7)",
            "href": "https://www.samba.org/samba/docs/current/man-html/samba.7.html"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The [[p0]] VFS module records selected client operations to both the [[p1]] log and system log (using [[p2]]).",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "code",
            "text": "extd_audit"
          }
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "link",
            "text": "smbd(8)",
            "href": "https://www.samba.org/samba/docs/current/man-html/smbd.8.html"
          }
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "link",
            "text": "syslog(3)",
            "href": "https://www.samba.org/samba/docs/current/man-html/syslog.3.html"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Other than logging to the [[p0]] log, [[p1]] is identical to [[p2]].",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "link",
            "text": "smbd(8)",
            "href": "https://www.samba.org/samba/docs/current/man-html/smbd.8.html"
          }
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "code",
            "text": "vfs_extd_audit"
          }
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "inline": {
            "tag": "link",
            "text": "vfs_audit(8)",
            "href": "https://www.samba.org/samba/docs/current/man-html/vfs_audit.8.html"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This module is stackable.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0010",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "VERSION",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This man page is part of version 4.25.0 of the Samba suite.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "AUTHOR",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The original Samba software and related utilities were created by Andrew Tridgell. Samba is now developed by the Samba Team as an Open Source project similar to the way the Linux kernel is developed.",
